{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re only seeing a handful of screenshots here.</strong><br>No trailer, no big showcase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But look a little closer, and you might see the beginning of a world that one day won\u2019t let you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shards of Memories</strong> will be a <strong>hand-drawn 2D</strong> <strong>Metroidvania</strong> filled with challenging battles, precise platforming, and locations that will stay with you long after you leave them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful foes to gain abilities through their memories, opening new paths along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit that <strong>Wishlist</strong> button, not because this page already shows you everything,<br>but because you want to see what it becomes<br>and maybe, one day, be able to say: I was here before everyone else.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918470?t=1755726647","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918470/99b95dca462e63fb2aacbcae7f8a1c7c6caadf72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755726647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918470/d9eb991539e04eae323205d93352d8f77bccafb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755726647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918470/d9eb991539e04eae323205d93352d8f77bccafb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755726647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re only seeing a handful of screenshots here.</strong><br>No trailer, no big showcase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But look a little closer, and you might see the beginning of a world that